<Base title="About — Brian J. Mueller">
  <section class="wrap stack stack-l">
    <div class="stack stack-m prose">
      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>Brian J. Mueller</h1>
      <hr class="rule-short" />
      <p>My journey with poetry began between college lectures, but it truly took flight through
         the rhythm of my favourite songs and the landscapes of my travels. In 2002 I published my
         debut collection, <em>Bull Head</em>. Since then I have evolved my craft across eight
         subsequent volumes.</p>
      <p>For five years I shared my work daily through <em>Brian's Poem of the Day</em>. That
         project blossomed into a deeper calling: a request to design a writing retreat focused on
         healing and spiritual growth for men. I have now had the privilege of co-leading this
         annual retreat for a decade.</p>
      <p>I believe poetry is the language of the soul.</p>
